  "description": "Microsoft Semantic Kernel connector (IChatCompletionService and an embedding generator) for LiteRtLmSharp on-device LLM inference and embeddings — a thin layer over the LiteRtLmSharp.Extensions.AI IChatClient and IEmbeddingGenerator. Companion to the LiteRtLmSharp package. Unofficial community bindings, not affiliated with or endorsed by Google. LiteRT is a trademark of Google LLC.",
